    "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), from the CLI's local logs on this Mac (input, output and cache), with the estimated API-equivalent cost. Usage on other machines or the web isn't included.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), from the CLI's local logs on this Mac (input, output and cache), with the estimated API-equivalent cost. Usage on other machines or the web isn't included.%@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son 24 saatin her birindeki token’lar (yerel saatiniz); bu Mac’teki CLI’nin yerel günlüklerinden (girdi, çıktı ve önbellek), tahmini API eşdeğeri maliyetle. Başka makinelerdeki veya web’deki kullanım dahil değildir.%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), the newest on the right. Darker squares mean more tokens; hover a square for its total.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), the newest on the right. Darker squares mean more tokens; hover a square for its total.%@"
